      {
        "text": "And thrice have I delivered them out of the hands of their enemies, and they have repented not of their sins.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "Morm. 2:26; 3:8 (7–8)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 3:13",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And when they had sworn by all that had been forbidden them by our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ, that they would go up unto their enemies to battle, and avenge themselves of the blood of their brethren, behold the voice of the Lord came unto me, saying:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "3 Ne. 12:34."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
