        "reference": "Mormon 3:15",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that I utterly refused to go up against mine enemies; and I did even as the Lord had commanded me; and I did stand as an idle witness to manifest unto the world the things which I saw and heard, according to the manifestations of the Spirit which had testified of things to come.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 3:16",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore I write unto you, Gentiles, and also unto you, house of Israel, when the work shall commence, that ye shall be about to prepare to return to the land of your inheritance;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "2 Ne. 30:3 (3–8); 3 Ne. 29:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 3:17",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, behold, I write unto all the ends of the earth; yea, unto you, twelve tribes of Israel, who shall be judged according to your works by the twelve whom Jesus chose to be his disciples in the land of Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 106,
            "end": 112,
            "text": "Matt. 19:28; Luke 22:30 (29–30); D&C 29:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mormon 3:18",
        "book": "Mormon",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And I write also unto the remnant of this people, who shall also be judged by the twelve whom Jesus chose in this land; and they shall be judged by the other twelve whom Jesus chose in the land of Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [
